      "description": "## 🔄 Create Business Registration Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2 | Get Business Registration Configuration | (Optional) Retrieve the institution's available online features and additional services if they are not already known. |\n| 3a | \\[Option 1\\] Create Business Registration | Submit a business registration request containing only the required fields. |\n| 3b | \\[Option 2\\] Create Business Registration - Online Features & Additional Services | Submit a business registration request with optional online features and additional services populated. |\n| 3c | \\[Option 3\\] Create Business Registration - Secondary Admin | Submit a business registration request with one primary admin and one secondary admin. |\n| 3d | \\[Option 4\\] Create Business Registration - Multiple TINs | Submit a business registration request with both primary and secondary TIN values. |",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {},
            "exec": [
              "const requiredVars = [",
              "    'primary_tin_number',",
              "    'primary_member_number',",
              "    'host_password'",
              "];",
              "",
              "const missingVars = requiredVars.filter((varName) => !pm.environment.get(varName));",
              "",
              "if (missingVars.length > 0) {",
              "    throw new Error(",
              "        `Missing required environment variables: ${missingVars.join(', ')}. Please set them in the active environment before running requests.`",
              "    );",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
